            </div>
            <!--
                Gutter carried by `.cap_mm_row` (13px on the mock-ups).

                `row-cols-lg-5` and not `col-lg`: the five cards have to fit on a
                single row (Mega1 mock-up). With `col-lg` (`flex: 1 0 0%`) the
                implicit `min-width: auto` of a flex item rises to the longest
                word of the card, which could push the last two onto a second
                row.
